-- test: in a package of edition 0.4 that imports no name of the server, a value of a type parameter holds no reply right, so a generic `start` under a `secret` program counter is no U4003 of IF6; the call that its task runs stands under that program counter, a check point that the schedule of started tasks counts, so it is U4002 (spec/31 §1, ADR 0123 IF6, spec/27 §8 rule 5, #1684)
-- spec: spec/31 §1
-- expect: error U4002 at src/m.una:12:13
module m

crunch[T](x: T) -> Unit = unit

pub spawn[T](x: T, key: secret Bool) -> Unit
=
  tasks
    if key
      start crunch(x)
    else
      unit
